014500* ---------------------------------------------------------------*
014600* 1000-INITIALISE                                                *
014700* START OF RUN                                                   *
014800* ---------------------------------------------------------------*
014900 1000-INITIALISE.
015000     MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE(1:8) TO WS-RUN-TS
