016300* ---------------------------------------------------------------*
016400* 2000-PROCESS                                                   *
016500* PROCESS LOOP                                                   *
016600* ---------------------------------------------------------------*
016700 2000-PROCESS.
016800     EXEC SQL
016900         OPEN C-PAYMENT-BATCH
017000     END-EXEC
017100     EVALUATE SQLCODE
017200         WHEN 0
017300             CONTINUE
017400         WHEN OTHER
017500             MOVE '2000-OPEN-C-PAYMENT-BATCH' TO ERR-PARA
017600             PERFORM 8000-SQL-ERROR
017700     END-EVALUATE
