028500     END-IF
028600     .
028700* ---------------------------------------------------------------*
028800* 6000-COMMIT-CHECK                                              *
028900* PERIODIC COMMIT                                                *
029000* ---------------------------------------------------------------*
029100 6000-COMMIT-CHECK.
029200     ADD 1 TO WS-SINCE-COMMIT
029300     IF WS-SINCE-COMMIT >= WS-COMMIT-FREQ
029400         EXEC SQL
029500             COMMIT
029600         END-EXEC
029700         MOVE ZERO TO WS-SINCE-COMMIT
029800     END-IF
029900     .
030000* ---------------------------------------------------------------*
030100* 9000-TERMINATE                                                 *
030200* CLOSE DOWN                                                     *
030300* ---------------------------------------------------------------*
